msgstr "ค่าเริ่มต้นเป็นภาษาอังกฤษที่ใช้เมื่อไม่มี locale bundle"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ICON_ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: ICON\\_ELEMENTS"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: ICON\\_ELEMENTS"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ICON_ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Base element names that actually call [iconSvg](../functions/iconSvg.md) to render an inline glyph, as opposed to the\nseparate, CSS-only `-icon-<name>` glyph painting most components use (a mask on a CSS custom\nproperty, no JS resolution involved). `date-time-input` isn't listed because it doesn't call\n`iconSvg` itself — it nests `date-input`/`calendar` (see [NESTED\\_DEPS](NESTED_DEPS.md)), which do."
msgstr "Base element names that actually call [iconSvg](../functions/iconSvg.md) to render an inline glyph, as opposed to the\nseparate, CSS-only `-icon-&lt;name&gt;` glyph painting most components use (a mask on a CSS custom\nproperty, no JS resolution involved). `date-time-input` isn't listed because it doesn't call\n`iconSvg` itself — it nests `date-input`/`calendar` (see [NESTED\\_DEPS](NESTED_DEPS.md)), which do."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/LOCALES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: LOCALES"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: LOCALES"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/LOCALES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "All 44 supported locales keyed by BCP47 tag, with direction and display label."
msgstr "ทุกรูปแบบภาษาที่รองรับ 44 รายการ จัดเป็นคีย์โดยแท็ก BCP47 พร้อมข้อมูลทิศทางและป้ายแสดงผล"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/NESTED_DEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: NESTED\\_DEPS"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: NESTED\\_DEPS"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/NESTED_DEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Elements whose shadow markup renders another element, so registering one requires its dependencies\ntoo: `<instui-date-time-input>` renders a `<instui-date-input>`, which renders a `<instui-calendar>`.\n[register](../functions/register.md)'s `only` filter expands through this (transitively) so a cherry-picked subset still\nworks. Keyed by base name; values are direct dependencies."
msgstr "Elements whose shadow markup renders another element, so registering one requires its dependencies\ntoo: `&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;` renders a `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;`, which renders a `&lt;instui-calendar&gt;`.\n[register](../functions/register.md)'s `only` filter expands through this (transitively) so a cherry-picked subset still\nworks. Keyed by base name; values are direct dependencies."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: alert"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: alert"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-alert>` — an inline status message with `role=\"alert\"`. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-<variant>` modifier (`info`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`). Alerts are elevated by default;\nset `has-shadow=\"false\"` to flatten one (→ `-without-shadow`, mirroring InstUI's `hasShadow={false}`).\nThe `timeout` attribute (milliseconds) auto-dismisses the alert after that delay — it fades out,\nremoves itself from the DOM, and fires a cancelable bubbling `dismiss` event (call `preventDefault()`\non it to keep the alert mounted). The fade states use `@pantoken/components`' `transition` utility;\nload its stylesheet when using timeout dismissal. Slotted content is the message body."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-alert&gt;` — an inline status message with `role=\"alert\"`. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier (`info`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`). Alerts are elevated by default;\nset `has-shadow=\"false\"` to flatten one (→ `-without-shadow`, mirroring InstUI's `hasShadow={false}`).\nThe `timeout` attribute (milliseconds) auto-dismisses the alert after that delay — it fades out,\nremoves itself from the DOM, and fires a cancelable bubbling `dismiss` event (call `preventDefault()`\non it to keep the alert mounted). The fade states use `@pantoken/components`' `transition` utility;\nload its stylesheet when using timeout dismissal. Slotted content is the message body."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: ar"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: ar"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Arabic (العربية) locale bundle."
msgstr "บันเดิลท้องถิ่นสำหรับภาษาอาหรับ (العربية)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: avatar"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: avatar"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-avatar>` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-<variant>`,\n`size` to `-size-<size>`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `<img>` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-avatar&gt;` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`,\n`size` to `-size-&lt;size&gt;`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `&lt;img&gt;` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/badge.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: badge"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: badge"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/badge.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-badge>` — a small count/status badge. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-<variant>` modifier; slotted content is the count or label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-badge&gt;` — a small count/status badge. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier; slotted content is the count or label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: button"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: button"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-button>` — a token-styled `<button>`. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-<variant>`\nmodifier (`secondary`, `tertiary`, `success`, `danger`, `ai`, …); `margin` adds spacing around the\nhost (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-button&gt;` — a token-styled `&lt;button&gt;`. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`\nmodifier (`secondary`, `tertiary`, `success`, `danger`, `ai`, …); `margin` adds spacing around the\nhost (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional `popovertargetaction`) toggles any\nlight-DOM `[popover]` such as `<instui-context-view>`, `<instui-popover>`, or `<instui-tray>`, and\n`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`<instui-modal>` with `--show`/`--close`,\netc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it resolves across the shadow\nboundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."
msgstr "It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional `popovertargetaction`) toggles any\nlight-DOM `[popover]` such as `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;`, `&lt;instui-popover&gt;`, or `&lt;instui-tray&gt;`, and\n`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`&lt;instui-modal&gt;` with `--show`/`--close`,\netc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it resolves across the shadow\nboundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ca.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: ca"
msgstr "# ตัวแปร: ca"

